        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-11-11T17:28:22.048Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If I helped you figure anything out for yourself, I’m genuinely glad to have done so.</p>\n<p>And I want to make it clear I was not trying to invalidate your own opinion in any way or think you were being judgmental about others. Just the opposite honestly: To validate you that I actually think people mostly feel the exact same way you do and it just manifests in different outward reactions.</p>",
